    "text": "According to Newton's law of cooling, the rate of cooling of a body is proportional to $(\\Delta \\theta)^{\\mathrm{n}}$, where $\\Delta \\theta$ is the difference of the temperature of the body and the surroundings, and $n$ is equal to"
