  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{dH}}{\\mathrm{dt}} \\propto\\left(\\theta_2-\\theta_1\\right)=(\\Delta \\theta)^{\\mathrm{n}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{n}=1$"
